'''Offering to the Gods''' (神へのお供え, ''Kami e no Osonae'', '''Offering to the Gods''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Cat Base Defense UP (M): Cat Base health is increased by 50%.

